' Space on an item (`MapViewOverlayNearbyAction`, `preset classic ai none
' seed 3 start 30`, Paradise Camp; Extended lays its items out otherwise and
' has none there): the leader walks to beside the
' bottle lying by the tree south-west of the well; Tab targets it (an item
' is a candidate within 20) and Space is the click on it, which opens the
' pile with the bottle in it (`item_pile`).
press escape             ' Back closes the manual v1.2 opens on a new game's first world map (MapScene.cs:687-691)
mapclick 110,122         ' into Paradise Camp
wait 60
mapclick 180,235         ' beside the bottle
wait 120
press tab                ' target: bottle
wait 2
press space              ' the pile
wait 60
snap item_pile
quit
